# reading gJ=0 in single ion property file Co2p.sipf -> entering intermediate coupling mode by assigning Ja=Sa Jb=La Jc=Sb Jd=Lb Je=Sc Jf=Lc (S... Spin, L... angular momentum)
# q=0.5 0.5 0:
# Miller indices of q vector with respect to primitive reciprocal lattice: (0.5000 1.0000 0.5000)
#
# Lattice Constants (A)
#! a=3.91 b=3.91 c=12.6 alpha=  90 beta=  90 gamma=  90
#! r1a=   1 r2a=   1 r3a= 0.5
#! r1b=   0 r2b=   1 r3b= 0.5   primitive lattice vectors [a][b][c]
#! r1c=   0 r2c=   0 r3c= 0.5
#! nofatoms=1  nofcomponents=3  number of atoms in primitive unit cell/number of components of each spin
#*********************************************************************
#! da=   0 [a] db=   0 [b] dc=   0 [c] nofneighbours=16 diagonalexchange=1 gJ=0 sipffilename=Co2p.sipf
#0 0 1 0 0 0 0 2 1 6
 1.4946 -1.4946
 0.00   -0.00
 0.0008 0.0008
 

